# Intentionally empty.
#
# Wrangler loads .env / .env.local by default and uploads what it finds as Worker
# secrets on `wrangler deploy`. This site is a static export with no Worker code,
# so it needs no secrets at all, and the Amazon API keys in .env.local must not be
# shipped to Cloudflare. Pointing wrangler at this empty file keeps them local.
#
# The one build-time variable the site does use, NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL, is baked
# into the HTML by `next build` before wrangler ever runs.
